From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xianwei Zhao <xianwei.zhao@amlogic.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Dec 2025 05:37:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/20] arm64: dts: amlogic: Add S7D Reset Controller

Add the device node and related header file for Amlogic
S7D reset controller.

Signed-off-by: Xianwei Zhao <xianwei.zhao@amlogic.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20251223-reset-s6-s7-s7d-v2-4-958f341449f1@amlogic.com
---
 .../boot/dts/amlogic/amlogic-s7d-reset.h      | 134 ++++++++++++++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/amlogic-s7d.dtsi  |   8 ++
 2 files changed, 142 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/amlogic-s7d-reset.h

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/amlogic-s7d-reset.h b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/amlogic-s7d-reset.h
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..fb15a93d9
--- /dev/null
